{% comment %}
  Renders the ZINSETT TrustStrip (Design Brief §5 `TrustStrip`): a 3-item
  payment/shipping/returns trust row — "🔒 Tap secure · 🚚 8–15 day tracked ·
  ↩ 30-day returns" — using Dawn's existing inline SVG icon set in place of
  the emoji placeholders (icons are decorative, aria-hidden; the label text
  carries the meaning). Horizontal row ≥640px, stacked below it, per §5.
  Tokens only (component-zinsett-trust-strip.css) — no hardcoded hex.

  This snippet is intentionally decoupled from the PDP: `sections/main-product.
  liquid` is the first caller (Brief C-5, rendered directly under the ATC
  button), and it's written to be reused as-is from the cart drawer, cart
  page, and footer in Brief C-6 without modification.

  Accepts:
  - hide_returns: {Boolean} omit the "30-day returns" item (optional; C-6 is
    expected to drive this from a theme setting once the returns policy page
    is live — defaults to false/shown since that setting doesn't exist yet).

  Usage:
  {% render 'trust-strip' %}
  {% render 'trust-strip', hide_returns: true %}
{% endcomment %}
<div class="trust-strip" role="list">
  <div class="trust-strip__item" role="listitem">
    <span class="trust-strip__icon svg-wrapper" aria-hidden="true">
      {{- 'icon-lock.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
    </span>
    <span>{{ 'products.product.zinsett_trust_secure' | t }}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="trust-strip__item" role="listitem">
    <span class="trust-strip__icon svg-wrapper" aria-hidden="true">
      {{- 'icon-truck.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
    </span>
    <span>{{ 'products.product.zinsett_trust_shipping' | t }}</span>
  </div>
  {%- unless hide_returns -%}
    <div class="trust-strip__item" role="listitem">
      <span class="trust-strip__icon svg-wrapper" aria-hidden="true">
        {{- 'icon-return.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
      </span>
      <span>{{ 'products.product.zinsett_trust_returns' | t }}</span>
    </div>
  {%- endunless -%}
</div>
